<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n106798" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπᾰγωγ-ή</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>leading on gradually,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ κυνηγεσίου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Cyn.</u>
					6.12
				</span></i>
			; <i>leading on artfully,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.
				19.322
			</span></i> (
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπ-</span>
			, pl.), <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				4.50
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phot.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> Gramm., <i>introduction,
				use</i> of a form, <i><span class="en">
				A.D.
				<u>Synt.</u>
				206.19
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>clearing out</i> or <i>purging of the body downwards,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κοιλίας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dsc.
					3.25
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γαστρός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					6.278
				</span></i>
			, al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
				(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπάγω</span> intr.) <i>retreat,
				withdrawal,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				3.97
			</span></i>; <i>retreat</i> or <i>haven</i> for ships, <i><span class="en">
				Phot.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>sinking down, squatting</i> (cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπάγω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					B.
				</span></i>
			 IV), 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξ ὑπαγωγῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>HA</u>
					578b7
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			<i>irrigation-channel,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Sammelb.
				5126.25
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A.D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>V.</b>
			<i>bringing down</i> of a bandage, <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				<u>Fasc.</u>
				32
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
